<title>UK: HSBC to take 10 pct in Peru's Bancosur.</title>
<headline>HSBC to take 10 pct in Peru's Bancosur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banking giant HSBC Holdings/HSBC Holdings plc said on Tuesday it had agreed the purchase of a 10 percent shareholding in Banco del Sur del Peru S.A. Peru (Bancosur), from O'Higgins Central Hispanoamericano S.A. for $16 million.</p>
<p>The vendor is a Chile-based joint venture involving the Luksic Group, which has mining, industrial and financial interests in Chile, and Spanish commercial bank Banco Central Hispanoamericano SA.</p>
